# AI Cost-Control Rules

AI and OCR features must be treated as metered resources.

Never implement unlimited AI/OCR usage.

## Current MVP

No real AI calls.
No real OCR.
No real document processing.
No real image analysis.

Use placeholders only.

## Future rule

Before any AI/OCR action:

1. estimate usage
2. check organization limit
3. check action permission
4. check file/batch size
5. execute action
6. record usage
7. deduct credits

## Trial limits

Suggested trial constraints:

- 25 AI credits per organization
- no bulk processing
- max 5 documents/photos
- max 3 AI-generated estimates
- max file size 5 MB
- max PDF pages 10

## Dangerous features

Do not implement without explicit approval:

- processing 200 invoices
- unlimited receipt scanning
- unlimited image analysis
- background AI processing loops
- auto-regeneration without user action
- large PDF ingestion
- batch OCR in free trial

## UI requirement

When showing future AI/OCR features, mention:

- credits
- plan limits
- placeholder state
- paid feature where appropriate
